al bug.\n\nI'd like to answer your question anyway. It was a bug with an additional window in the editor, a pop-up window such as: Project -> Project Settings -> Visual Bug.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97070787-834c-4dfd-96c1-a6bc9afa4b59","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4816021388/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]